    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to a truly exceptional new homes development at Yourell`s Meadows - South - where design, craftsmanship and attention to detail reach an entirely new level.\n\nThese stunning 3 and 4 bedroom homes redefine modern living, with beautiful finishes throughout and a specification that simply sets a new benchmark in house quality. Every element has been carefully considered, from bespoke kitchens with quartz work tops and tailored cabinetry to expansive 9 Ft ceilings and elegant internal finishes.\n\nThe bathrooms and en suites are truly exceptional. Luxurious, contemporary spaces designed to impress, offering a show house standard that is second to none.\n\nThis is a development that oozes class and style at every turn, with exceptional extras included as standard. Energy efficient A rated homes combine cutting edge technology with timeless design, ensuring comfort, efficiency, and sophistication in equal measure.\n\nIdeally located just a short stroll from Malahide Castle and its stunning grounds, this is a rare opportunity to secure a home in one of Dublin`s most sought after coastal settings.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Heat Pump Technology </li><li> 9 ft ceiling height at ground floor level </li><li> Shaker style internal doors </li><li> Stone fireplace with slate hearth </li><li> Bespoke kitchens with quartz work surfaces </li><li> Floor to ceiling built in wardrobes </li><li> Luxurious bathrooms and ensuites </li><li> Cobblelock driveway </li><li> Porcelain patio tiles with levelled and seeded rear garden </li><li> 10 Year Home Bond Structural Guarantee</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2<br>BER No: 118879170<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 38.99 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
      {
